      "html": "<p>This is a free <strong>Care Inspectorate self-evaluation template</strong> for a Scottish care service. It follows the adult-care key questions. For each one, note your proof, give a grade and write an action.</p><p>Always use the latest published framework. This is general information, not regulatory advice.</p>"
