      "kind": "default",
      "eyebrow": "Key question 1",
      "heading": "How good is our care and support?",
      "html": "<p>Inspectors weigh this one most. Record honest proof against each row.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Area to check</th><th>Proof to gather</th><th>Your grade (1 to 6)</th><th>Action to improve</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>People get compassion, dignity and respect</td><td>What you saw. People's own words. Complaints and how they ended.</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Care is right for each person</td><td>Care plans reviewed and current. Choices recorded and kept.</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Care helps health and wellbeing</td><td>Food, activity and mood. Advice from health staff. How decline is spotted.</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>People are safe from harm</td><td>Safeguarding records. Risk assessments. Medication handling. Accident trends.</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table>"
